{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "As an Engineering Manager at Grab, I recently engaged in a coaching session to enhance my feedback skills during the 360 season conversation.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/7937cc0e5a0a9f793b81edb1b72bd94c521ac872495be9236d1e43f864dc744d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.58], [6, 1.98, 2.16], [7, 2.16, 2.46], [8, 2.46, 3.02], [9, 3.02, 3.22], [10, 3.22, 3.3], [11, 3.3, 3.54], [12, 3.54, 4.02], [13, 4.02, 4.32], [14, 4.32, 4.58], [15, 4.58, 4.82], [16, 4.82, 5.1], [17, 5.1, 5.6], [18, 5.6, 5.9], [19, 5.9, 6.06], [20, 6.06, 6.76], [21, 6.76, 7.32], [22, 7.32, 7.9]]}, {"text": "Despite my initial belief that I had mastered the art of management after three years, I approached the session with an open mind and was pleasantly surprised by the valuable insights gained.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/15f3a2baeaf49bc16ec4c9d6c9aecfb5d91055dd549291ec9f5d395171c53d10.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.24], [4, 1.24, 1.56], [5, 1.56, 1.72], [6, 1.72, 1.94], [7, 1.94, 2.32], [8, 2.32, 2.54], [9, 2.54, 2.68], [10, 2.68, 2.82], [11, 2.82, 3.18], [12, 3.18, 3.56], [13, 3.56, 3.86], [14, 3.86, 4.12], [15, 4.64, 4.76], [16, 4.76, 5.1], [17, 5.1, 5.3], [18, 5.3, 5.62], [19, 5.62, 5.82], [20, 5.82, 5.94], [21, 5.94, 6.14], [22, 6.14, 6.52], [23, 6.52, 6.84], [24, 6.84, 7.0], [25, 7.0, 7.38], [26, 7.38, 7.96], [27, 7.96, 8.14], [28, 8.14, 8.28], [29, 8.28, 8.68], [30, 8.68, 9.08], [31, 9.08, 9.5]]}, {"text": "Two key takeaways continue to resonate with me a week later: the importance of cultivating curiosity and allowing space for growth.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/2b5ec4c83726dce496fde3aa3fe1958aaaecdcfa77b18dc407a2fca53d83309b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.68], [6, 1.68, 1.96], [7, 1.96, 2.14], [8, 2.14, 2.32], [9, 2.32, 2.46], [10, 2.46, 2.82], [11, 3.26, 3.34], [12, 3.34, 3.72], [13, 3.72, 3.98], [14, 3.98, 4.52], [15, 4.52, 5.1], [16, 5.1, 5.4], [17, 5.4, 5.66], [18, 5.66, 6.02], [19, 6.02, 6.28], [20, 6.28, 6.54]]}, {"text": "These concepts have significantly influenced my approach to providing feedback, adding a fresh perspective to my managerial toolkit.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/f8088bc813a561f9041373c5adc32dc78033ee76e1ffd5632ac40b5e8ef1d1c8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.78], [2, 0.78, 1.0], [3, 1.0, 1.56], [4, 1.56, 2.2], [5, 2.2, 2.46], [6, 2.46, 2.8], [7, 2.8, 3.02], [8, 3.02, 3.36], [9, 3.36, 3.8], [10, 4.5, 4.66], [11, 4.66, 4.82], [12, 4.82, 4.98], [13, 4.98, 5.54], [14, 5.54, 5.76], [15, 5.76, 5.88], [16, 5.88, 6.52], [17, 6.52, 6.9]]}, {"text": "Stay tuned as I delve into these transformative ideas in my latest blog article!", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/a52a54e46b75518413cedc46001a90a0354393c4b82498087c376628be3d54c3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 0.96], [5, 0.96, 1.26], [6, 1.26, 1.46], [7, 1.46, 2.02], [8, 2.02, 2.48], [9, 2.48, 2.8], [10, 2.8, 2.96], [11, 2.96, 3.26], [12, 3.26, 3.54], [13, 3.54, 3.94]]}, {"text": "1/ Be Curious", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/2630a2a6405b30501f218d8bf22b67b121632af02e7003940aff21e2eb8f33bb.mp3"}, {"text": "Historically, my 1:1 conversations went like this:", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/32cc02907c3750d7b40c7d6abe9636102f21d97067ae967f8ad1a64cf9f25f32.mp3"}, {"text": "me: Hi, I noticed there was an issue in ___.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/ea833f2b699f081b53d597c3a238763cbb2645298f90c30dad0792c0d1be7aa0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.64, 0.86], [2, 1.26, 1.4], [3, 1.4, 1.66], [4, 1.66, 1.94], [5, 1.94, 2.06], [6, 2.06, 2.16], [7, 2.16, 2.46], [8, 2.46, 2.7]]}, {"text": "can you tell me more about that?", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/e8124b681e1808f2b1efff4e0b52ae784336a5ad3e590641c7e80281f3cf1f97.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.66], [4, 0.66, 0.86], [5, 0.86, 1.08], [6, 1.08, 1.32]]}, {"text": "them: don’t worry I fixed it.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/0a8938d6f1e8672d17b3eca7283017b77e53b0be8b3cd5d907f456ca26ec1475.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.68, 0.84], [2, 0.84, 1.08], [3, 1.08, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.48], [5, 1.48, 1.74]]}, {"text": "me: thanks for fixing it.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/eecef017a234c5e936bb97127e268cc6e302b6a5729bfc92e66f39d2f07ca802.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.24, 0.96], [2, 0.96, 1.1], [3, 1.1, 1.4], [4, 1.4, 1.66]]}, {"text": "but how can we prevent this from happening again?", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/50dcbe72f0175fe89c11dffa0ac1fa3f3093878660e9538d5c73a60eb74d4587.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.42], [3, 0.42, 0.54], [4, 0.54, 0.84], [5, 0.84, 1.08], [6, 1.08, 1.26], [7, 1.26, 1.62], [8, 1.62, 2.02]]}, {"text": "them: I will do better next time.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/bef9e386972326ed8c4f27f33c28d98d0d52f4cc67d900a2395c4e50a74b2e4d.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.68, 0.82], [2, 0.82, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.4], [5, 1.4, 1.68], [6, 1.68, 2.04]]}, {"text": "me: thats not the answer I was looking for.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/9e32401658a885cdb83821c0240dc3f76ceb0b16d8801745dc29c8630fde8b43.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.62, 0.92], [2, 0.92, 1.02], [3, 1.02, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.48], [5, 1.48, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 1.78], [7, 1.78, 1.98], [8, 1.98, 2.32]]}, {"text": "can you be more specific?", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/c176ead97395cf84ef7f2f38330295e36bc78a785443107248e7b1ac61a41af9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.42], [3, 0.42, 0.64], [4, 0.64, 1.16]]}, {"text": "them: I will be more careful.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/5bd6ae1b2ae8729e05d4a3227eb7df0c4d8aa8b67d78414a566cd4d23495ff10.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.72, 0.92], [2, 0.92, 1.04], [3, 1.04, 1.18], [4, 1.18, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.74]]}, {"text": "me: … me: let me just give you the answer.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/61a642a9749743bb2d4ceb941616431b055267cc87226e5c4e72e2129a3066e6.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.5, 0.94], [3, 1.22, 1.48], [4, 1.48, 1.62], [5, 1.62, 1.8], [6, 1.8, 2.02], [7, 2.02, 2.14], [8, 2.14, 2.28], [9, 2.28, 2.6]]}, {"text": "What if we try doing A, B, and C?", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/e8edbb0f9639d027c2ac417ecb20f96aef43c3cf64239e0c09421ce391ed62c6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.38], [3, 0.38, 0.6], [4, 0.6, 0.86], [6, 1.18, 1.4], [7, 1.4, 1.66], [8, 1.66, 1.9]]}, {"text": "In retrospect, I acknowledge the limitations of my approach as I lacked sufficient information to confidently recommend A, B, and C. I now recognize the importance of cultivating curiosity about the problem at hand before imposing my own biases and assumptions.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/87c9c74f3b3a2e5a6a4834adbe2bb0a348b7e3a571f50aeca8fa0b14e48159b7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.66], [2, 1.04, 1.12], [3, 1.12, 1.52], [4, 1.52, 1.74], [5, 1.74, 2.2], [6, 2.2, 2.48], [7, 2.48, 2.6], [8, 2.6, 2.96], [9, 2.96, 3.18], [10, 3.18, 3.28], [11, 3.28, 3.52], [12, 3.52, 4.02], [13, 4.02, 4.6], [14, 4.6, 4.88], [15, 4.88, 5.32], [16, 5.32, 5.98], [17, 5.98, 6.18], [18, 6.3, 6.36], [19, 6.44, 6.48], [20, 6.48, 6.74], [21, 7.28, 7.54], [22, 7.54, 7.7], [23, 7.7, 8.12], [24, 8.12, 8.36], [25, 8.36, 8.72], [26, 8.72, 8.94], [27, 8.94, 9.46], [28, 9.46, 9.88], [29, 9.88, 10.36], [30, 10.36, 10.52], [31, 10.52, 10.86], [32, 10.86, 11.02], [33, 11.02, 11.24], [34, 11.24, 11.58], [35, 11.58, 12.08], [36, 12.08, 12.28], [37, 12.28, 12.52], [38, 12.52, 12.86], [39, 12.86, 13.2], [40, 13.2, 13.6]]}, {"text": "Moving forward, I aim to adopt a more inquisitive mindset to better understand and address challenges.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/d9d1debc1551ceed1aea7ba1f43a801cdea275f594619b11d68d094941387105.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.66], [2, 1.12, 1.2], [3, 1.2, 1.4], [4, 1.4, 1.52], [5, 1.52, 1.8], [6, 1.8, 1.98], [7, 1.98, 2.12], [8, 2.12, 2.66], [9, 2.66, 3.14], [10, 3.14, 3.46], [11, 3.46, 3.66], [12, 3.66, 4.22], [13, 4.22, 4.52], [14, 4.52, 4.78], [15, 4.78, 5.36]]}, {"text": "2/ Give them space to solve their own problems", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/82ebb32934c7a4e3e2e233da3cc9a77971e608a4f6ad4032e6ed1f151af8ebfb.mp3"}, {"text": "In problem-solving, guiding individuals with strategic questions proves more effective than managers simply offering personal advice.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/563e04c8488cc045342a45efc9bb2553ee05aa94943865c45024e7ec194d8acc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [2, 1.58, 1.78], [3, 1.78, 2.38], [4, 2.38, 2.64], [5, 2.64, 3.08], [6, 3.08, 3.8], [7, 3.8, 4.02], [8, 4.02, 4.28], [9, 4.28, 4.7], [10, 4.7, 4.92], [12, 5.28, 5.66], [13, 5.66, 6.08], [14, 6.08, 6.6], [15, 6.6, 6.98]]}, {"text": "By delving into the root cause through thoughtful inquiry, people can tap into their creativity to discover solutions on their own.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/6075f0ed377343f9f331b35a01edb10936d20660cc7451c61ba88831c272c487.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 0.94], [5, 0.94, 1.24], [6, 1.24, 1.56], [7, 1.56, 1.92], [8, 1.92, 2.4], [9, 2.98, 3.14], [10, 3.14, 3.32], [11, 3.32, 3.54], [12, 3.54, 3.78], [13, 3.78, 3.92], [14, 3.92, 4.34], [15, 4.34, 4.7], [16, 4.7, 5.02], [17, 5.02, 5.52], [18, 5.52, 5.76], [19, 5.76, 5.9], [20, 5.9, 6.14]]}, {"text": "This approach fosters self-discovery and empowers individuals to navigate challenges autonomously.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../assets/blog-audio/5ca92d15e815068855ff54cfbf280eee8f25632d9cb8aeb0026bea36834c90d1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 1.02], [4, 1.92, 2.12], [5, 2.12, 2.58], [6, 2.58, 3.26], [7, 3.26, 3.54], [8, 3.54, 3.9], [9, 3.9, 4.5], [10, 4.5, 5.36]]}]}